  {
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "`cusolverDnSgesvd_bufferSize` grows linear in cuda 9.0.\r\nI guess that they changed the allocation algorithm and together with the `int` return type it blowed up.\r\n\r\n@anaruse do you have any insight on this issue?",
